## Question 5

1. `x -> System.out.println(x)` → `System.out::println`  
   Type: Bound Instance method reference.

2. `s -> s.toUpperCase()` → `String::toUpperCase`  
   Type: Unbound Instance method reference.

3. `x -> Math.abs(x)` → `Math::abs`  
   Type: Static method reference.

4. `() -> new ArrayList<>()` → `ArrayList::new`  
   Type: Constructor reference.

5. `(s1, s2) -> s1.compareTo(s2)` → `String::compareTo`  
   Type: Unbound Instance method reference.

